[2026-07-30T15:51:56.278Z] [master 5200beb63] NetApp: default transport to HTTPS and warn on HTTP Change NetApp Cinder driver default netapp_transport_type from http to https for secure-by-default behavior. Also add an initialization warning when operators explicitly configure http transport, indicating that it is insecure and not recommended for production. Includes unit coverage for warning/no-warning behavior and a regression test for the HTTPS default. Closes-Bug: #2157914
